  "fullDescription": "Create bold, playful artwork with the Blockhead Duo Procreate Brushes. This two-brush set includes the expressive Blockhead Inker and the textured Chunkyard Fill, making it easy to sketch, ink, and add chunky color with an organic hand-drawn feel.\n\nPerfect for quirky characters, cartoons, monsters, animals, mandalas, doodles, coloring pages, comics, and whimsical illustrations. The Blockhead Inker delivers bold, slightly rough linework, while Chunkyard Fill adds rich textured color that pairs perfectly with the inker.\n\nIncludes:\n– Blockhead Inker\n– Chunkyard Fill\n\nCompatible with Procreate on iPad.",
